{"nodes": [{"id": "readme_kenda", "label": "Kenda (PWA de suivi des boires de b\u00e9b\u00e9)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L1-L11", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "readme_fichiers_statiques_sans_compilation", "label": "Fichiers statiques, aucune compilation ni npm", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L8", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "M\u00eame approche que les projets fr\u00e8res Calico et Panache : juste des fichiers statiques, publi\u00e9s \u00e0 chaque git push."}, {"id": "readme_supabase", "label": "Supabase (donn\u00e9es, temps r\u00e9el, connexion ; offre gratuite)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L9", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "readme_cloudflare_workers", "label": "H\u00e9bergement Cloudflare Workers (main = production, dev = Kenda DEV)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L42-L63", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Cycle : commit + push sur dev, test sur Kenda DEV, puis fusion dans main pour publier."}, {"id": "readme_cle_publique_et_rls", "label": "Cl\u00e9 publishable dans le navigateur, s\u00e9curit\u00e9 par les r\u00e8gles RLS", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L39-L40", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "La cl\u00e9 est faite pour vivre dans le navigateur ; la vraie s\u00e9curit\u00e9 vient des r\u00e8gles RLS de schema.sql (on ne voit que les b\u00e9b\u00e9s qu'on suit)."}, {"id": "readme_confirm_email_desactive", "label": "Confirmation de courriel d\u00e9sactiv\u00e9e (compte actif tout de suite)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L21-L23", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Aucun courriel \u00e0 envoyer ; m\u00eame r\u00e9glage que Calico et Panache."}, {"id": "readme_garde_eveil_supabase", "label": "Garde-\u00e9veil Supabase : deux gardiens ind\u00e9pendants", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L65-L76", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "L'offre gratuite met le projet en pause apr\u00e8s 7 jours sans activit\u00e9 ; il faut quelques requ\u00eates par jour. Doublon volontaire (cron Cloudflare de worker.js + GitHub Actions) : deux gardiens ind\u00e9pendants valent mieux qu'un."}, {"id": "readme_ping_endpoint", "label": "Point de v\u00e9rification /_ping (\u00ab Supabase r\u00e9pond. \u00bb)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L75-L76", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "readme_code_de_partage", "label": "Code de partage (rejoindre le suivi d'un b\u00e9b\u00e9)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L82-L90", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "readme_quantites_en_ml", "label": "Quantit\u00e9s gard\u00e9es en ml ; unit\u00e9 ml/oz = r\u00e9glage partag\u00e9 du b\u00e9b\u00e9", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L96-L97", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Toujours en ml dans la base ; l'unit\u00e9 est un r\u00e9glage du b\u00e9b\u00e9, jamais redemand\u00e9 \u00e0 la saisie. 1 oz = 29,5735 ml."}, {"id": "readme_compteurs_aujourd_hui_24h", "label": "Compteurs \u00ab Aujourd'hui \u00bb (depuis minuit) et \u00ab Derni\u00e8res 24 h \u00bb (fen\u00eatre glissante)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L98-L100", "source_url": null, "c